message: "If you use this material, please cite it as below."
title: "Convex Optimization: online lecture notes with worked exercises"
abstract: >-
  The lecture notes of the Convex Optimization course — functions of several
  variables, convex sets, convex and concave functions, quadratic functions,
  convex and concave optimization problems — with definitions, theorems and
  proofs, worked examples and exercises with solutions.
